/*
 * Implements helper constructors used throughout Ymir’s pattern-matching
 * validation pipeline.
 *
 * These helpers are responsible for:
 *   - expanding tuple values into lists of element values
 *   - constructing conditional expressions for match branches
 *   - generating placeholder error variables when pattern validation fails
 *
 * The module centralizes small but essential building blocks that keep
 * the rest of the match-validation logic clean and uniform.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::control::match_::create
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/control/match_/create.yr
 * @Author(s):
